The events (names, dates, venues, attractions, classifications, sales,
prices, pictures) come from the Ticketmaster Discovery API
(https://developer.ticketmaster.com), read with the API key of each user
under the Ticketmaster terms of use. They belong to Ticketmaster and to the
event organizers; the pictures shown in the widgets are downloaded from
Ticketmaster's image servers when a dashboard shows them, and none is part of
this repository (the pictures of the widget illustrations are drawn by
docs/illustrations/gen.mjs).

The answers used in test/ are built by hand from the documentation of the
Discovery API, not copied from it.

